'''Blanchard Montgomery III''' (born February 17, 1961) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[linebacker]] in the [[National Football League]] (NFL).

After playing his [[College football|college ball]] at [[UCLA Bruins football|UCLA]], Montgomery was selected in the third round of the [[1983 NFL draft]].  Montgomery played just two seasons in the NFL, but was a member of the [[Super Bowl XIX]] champion [[San Francisco 49ers]] team.

